@startuml kairos-security-dashboard-sequence
title View Security Dashboard

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Security Dashboard
WebAdmin -> API: GET /security/dashboard
API -> DB: Aggregate recent access logs, failed logins,\nrole distribution
DB --> API: metrics
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {securitySummary}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Render cards and tables

@enduml
